                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "383cb90b-75f8-4997-8e3e-8a06450dd263",
                        "entry_id": "e3f6be3e-79cd-3c54-91a4-3bc2150dd622",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "short-form"
                        ],
                        "form": "па́дки"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6ce63975-c092-360e-a2d4-0cc22a183416",
                        "entry_id": "e3f6be3e-79cd-3c54-91a4-3bc2150dd622",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. питающий сильное пристрастие к чему-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "785908ce-ed3e-4950-a09f-48ad291039b9",
                                "sense_id": "6ce63975-c092-360e-a2d4-0cc22a183416",
                                "text": "Правда, он лгал, да ведь падок уж очень, выдержать не может."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "948fa163-91b8-461e-9afd-6fde69f79170",
                                "sense_id": "6ce63975-c092-360e-a2d4-0cc22a183416",
                                "text": "Оттого-то так и падки наши барышни до французов, что форма у них хороша."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0ddec98-66c2-4c6b-98dc-210f8a467180",
                                "sense_id": "6ce63975-c092-360e-a2d4-0cc22a183416",
                                "text": "На ведение дневников чрезвычайно падки молодые люди."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91a6bfd4-6bd9-4448-9007-ab69a20ce0a2",
                                "sense_id": "6ce63975-c092-360e-a2d4-0cc22a183416",
                                "text": "Звали медвежонка Бумбой, был он растяпым, падким на сласти и очень ласковым."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea84dfee-a924-450d-bff0-62206540a057",
                        "source_entry_id": "e3f6be3e-79cd-3c54-91a4-3bc2150dd622",
                        "source_sense_id": "6ce63975-c092-360e-a2d4-0cc22a183416",
                        "target_lang_word": "having",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "having",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "defa46d8-3fee-33fd-827b-945fd8ba984d",
                                        "entry_id": "81362e7e-cf14-3d5b-bbd4-1f9565561431",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of have"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "having",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd9af5e4-fdcc-31bd-860e-35e1e288fdf9",
                                        "entry_id": "68ffbc0a-00a8-36bf-8ca9-9e6d355ddec3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of possessing; ownership."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4377cce1-4a2f-40f3-8874-3bbed1117853",
                                                "sense_id": "fd9af5e4-fdcc-31bd-860e-35e1e288fdf9",
                                                "text": "He thus came to think of perceiving as a complex of 'havings,' not a complex of 'havings' and 'doings.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4de9c5db-2ca4-36e5-bf23-fd46ab39ebf0",
                                        "entry_id": "68ffbc0a-00a8-36bf-8ca9-9e6d355ddec3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something owned; possession; goods; estate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2767d9d4-d74f-4067-a147-40674ff46147",
                                                "sense_id": "4de9c5db-2ca4-36e5-bf23-fd46ab39ebf0",
                                                "text": "Out of my lean and low ability\nI’ll lend you something: my having is not much;\nI’ll make division of my present with you:\nHold, there’s half my coffer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32147d9c-ea14-4998-9c6e-a09c469ef5d9",
                                                "sense_id": "4de9c5db-2ca4-36e5-bf23-fd46ab39ebf0",
                                                "text": "Your havings wasted by the scythe and spade—\nYour rights and charters hobnail’d into slush—"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0148c51c-260e-3cb5-80a9-048688b34b31",
                                        "entry_id": "68ffbc0a-00a8-36bf-8ca9-9e6d355ddec3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person's behaviour."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c33da983-3514-3289-bbfb-8bd683cd6606",
                                        "entry_id": "68ffbc0a-00a8-36bf-8ca9-9e6d355ddec3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Good manners."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Scotland",
                                            "countable",
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "having",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd3d5b39-08c0-3ee2-a050-ca7291dc063f",
                                        "entry_id": "3bb70d57-53b6-31d0-a579-f7d0d00bd9de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grasping; greedy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "844d746c-4c7e-4d39-981f-3e360645f791",
                                                "sense_id": "dd3d5b39-08c0-3ee2-a050-ca7291dc063f",
                                                "text": "The new man in Humanity, which is the communication of the Son of Man Who is the Interceder, is an asking man, although it is not a greedy and a having man."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
